<https://homosaurus.org/v2/FtMs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Females transitioning to males" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/FtMs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "FtM transsexuals" .
