<https://homosaurus.org/v2/cheating> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "cheating" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/cheating> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cheating" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/cheating> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Straying" .
