<https://homosaurus.org/v2/cheating> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Stepping out" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/cheating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A violation of a couple's assumed or stated contract regarding emotional and/or sexual exclusivity. Should not be used to refer to non-monogamy in general, as cheating is possible in both monogamous and non-monogamous relationships." .
