<https://homosaurus.org/v2/compersion> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compersion" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/compersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The positive emotion an individual may experience in regards to their partner's relationship with another partner. Often defined as the opposite of jealousy." .
