<https://homosaurus.org/v2/compulsoryMonogamy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compulsory monogamy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/compulsoryMonogamy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The assumption that all people share a desire for monogamous relationships and that this is a preferential life goal." .
