<https://homosaurus.org/v2/consensualNonMonogamy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "consensualNonMonogamy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/consensualNonMonogamy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Consensual non-monogamy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/consensualNonMonogamy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Practice of romantic or sexual relationships with more than one person simultaneously and with all the consent of all partners involved." .
