<https://homosaurus.org/v2/nestingPartners> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "nestingPartners" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/nestingPartners> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nesting partners" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v2/nestingPartners> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used in non-monogamous communities to refer to a partner that one lives with. Often used in place of language seen as hierarchical (e.g. primary/secondary partner)." .
